WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:07.000
It possesses enormous power,
and brings endless pleasure

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:10.960
and destruction  to those who are destined.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.720
The Witchblade.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.720
At this moment, one woman has awakened.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.460
Just before the shot, my chest feels like it's gonna tear open

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:37.050
I shout out countless times, break out

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:42.240
It's not over, rush through the endless night

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:47.530
Hot blood flows through my body

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:51.240
The moment it ultimately rots away

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:57.840
it's all over, fragments of an empty dream come to mind

00:00:58.310 --> 00:01:03.340
I can never go back, I can't remember a thing

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.880
I've been reduced to struggling, and my voice won't carry

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.390
Uncontrollable impulses

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:19.310
Give me your XTC, let me feel it one more time

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:26.530
This body heats up, and I shout out your name in the darkness

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:33.530
Give me your XTC, I don't need false love

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.710
I will accept it, sin and punishment

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:43.280
Slash through the destiny I've been set up with, Blade

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:52.010
"Danger"

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:20.130
Hold it, Maria! Let her go!

00:02:21.340 --> 00:02:22.850
First-aid team! Quickly!

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.730
How many times do I have to tell you, Maria?

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:33.770
This is training! Don't go overboard!

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:36.440
But...
No buts!

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:39.360
Chief Nishida!

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:46.030
No way...

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.870
That easily? How weird.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.210
Maria! She's one of your companions!
Show some regret!

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.010
I'm sick of this.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:03.260
You hate me, don't you?
I'm going to see my grandfather.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:07.560
I'm sorry. I spoke too harshly.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.640
Let's go shopping in town next week!

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:13.350
I'll buy you some new stuffed animals!

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:14.860
Alright.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:23.740
That makes five now.
Yes.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:31.000
I look forward to the future...

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:36.420
Who knows what'll happen if she
wears the blade we're developing...

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.390
How boring...

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.730
Nora.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.530
Yes?

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:06.240
I think I'll leave the
Witchblade matter in your hands.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:09.370
Understood. Right away.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.920
Good morning!

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.630
Are you all right?

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:28.430
Where am I?

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:31.640
You awake? This is my place.

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:32.720
What?!

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.980
You passed out in the park last night.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:39.230
So I had the people here carry you.

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.620
You were a real handful!

00:04:55.710 --> 00:05:00.000
You could've just contacted the company.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:02.590
I was drunk, too.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:05.260
Oh.

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:08.760
Then I thank you for

00:05:08.850 --> 00:05:11.140
The bathroom is over there.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:16.350
I've never seen him so weak before!

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:20.360
Don't get too interested.
He's your boss, you know.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.610
He's nothing that special.

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:27.820
He is, too. Plus he's much
better than Tozawa-Chan!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:32.530
You should marry him, Mom!
I wouldn't mind having him as a dad!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.910
Yuck, don't talk like that!

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:39.830
Here you go!

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.890
The sofa is all yours.
No, I have to be going.

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.890
If you move around now,
you'll just barf again!

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:57.770
Please get some rest! Here, it's that way!

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:03.360
Princess Rihoko's always right.
You should do what she says.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:09.610
This is hangover medicine.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:14.910
Now get some rest!
No, uhh...

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.290
Want anything to eat?

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:22.250
No, I'm fine.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.420
Thanks.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:30.220
Even you lose face when you're like this!

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:35.260
Oh! Miso soup might help!
I'll go buy some onions, Mom!

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:39.810
Want me to go instead?
No, you'd buy old, withered ones.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:43.110
Eh?! T-That's not true!

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:46.690
Yes, it is. Well, I'll be back!

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:51.740
What's this?
Don't look!

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:54.740
Now I gotta know...
It's a secret!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:01.000
You sneezed last night too, Riko.
Do you have a cold?

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.330
Doesn't your face seem a little red?

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:06.630
No, I'm fine! Well, I'm off!

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:12.800
Your daughter's really something.

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:15.300
She's my pride and joy!

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:19.810
I bet. She's more with-it than you are.

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:22.810
Says the guy who couldn't
even stand up yesterday...

00:07:22.900 --> 00:07:25.690
Only because you went wild at the party.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:28.530
Just like a kid at an amusement park!

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:32.780
What?! Then you shouldn't have
taken me in the first place!

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.990
Quiet! My head is killing me!

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:39.660
Ugh! You really piss me off!
After you were so cute last night...

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.330
Segawa? It's me.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.840
Sir! Where are you?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:50.010
Stuff happened. I'll be there this afternoon.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:52.760
No, you needn't come in today.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:53.880
What?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:57.600
Wadou-san stormed in here.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:01.140
Says he wants to ask you about the Witchblade.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:06.400
Plus there's the whole party incident,
so he's really keyed up.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:10.860
I felt it best to turn him away for today,
so I told him you were ill.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:12.860
There's no need for that.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:19.830
I really think it's best not to agitate
him right now. He is quite loud...

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.960
I apologize for the wait.

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:38.850
Unfortunately, it sounds like
Takayama can't move even a millimeter.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:42.600
It's such a shame,
after you've come all this way.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.680
Oh, there's dust...

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.980
Segawa-kun, was it?

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:55.650
I've been impressed with your
aptitude as a secretary for some time.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:57.860
I'm honored.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:01.330
The make of a man can be
told from his appearance.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:04.540
In that regard, you are truly impeccable.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:12.300
Why someone like you is stuck
as Takayama's secretary is baffling.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:15.760
I like things that are strong.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.800
I see.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:21.810
Continue to embrace that way of thinking.

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:23.970
Yagi, let's go.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.570
Naturally, I'll be taking the liberty of seeing

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:36.280
just how strong you are, Wadou-san.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:45.660
Oh, Rihoko-Chan! You got a cold?

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:48.080
No, I'm all right!

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:51.590
Rihoko-Chan! I got some
good freshwater clams today!

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:54.590
Perfect for your mom's hangovers!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:56.840
Clams are good for hangovers?

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:59.550
They're even better in miso soup!

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:03.600
Hold on, now! Don't forget
about onion miso soup!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:06.680
Rihoko-Chan! It's top-quality onion!
Take it with ya!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.810
Clams work better!

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:12.730
Quiet, old hag!
Rihoko-Chan came to my shop!

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.940
Don't be monopolizing her, you octopus!

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:18.860
H-Hey! Rihoko-Chan!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:22.120
Hey, what's wrong?!
Rihoko-Chan! Say something!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.990
Rihoko-Chan!

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:27.330
What do we do?!
Rihoko-Chan!

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:45.140
It feels weird, having Takayama in my home.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:52.100
Terrible news! Rihoko fainted at the market!

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:58.030
She was taken to the general hospital, but

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:01.610
Wait! I didn't finish talking yet!

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:04.990
Hey! You forgot your shoes!

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:11.330
Riko... I guess you
weren't all right, after all!

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:14.080
I'm sorry! I should've paid more attention!

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.510
Ugh! Now, of all times!

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:29.390
U-Umm, where can I find the general hospital?!

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:34.520
Excuse me! Where's the general hospital?!

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:38.730
Get in!

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:53.870
Honestly. You rushed off
without knowing where to go?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:57.750
I'm left speechless.
But Rihoko's

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:02.670
Hear me out. Sounds like
there's no need to be that worried.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:03.880
Eh?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:09.060
A doctor who was passing by
treated her and took her to the hospital.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:26.780
Riko! Riko!

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:30.740
Are you her mother?
Yes!

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.710
Umm, how is Riko?! How is she?!

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:38.130
She's all right. It was acute
enteritis brought on by a cold.

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.000
She'll be better soon.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.300
She will?

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.340
Thank goodness...

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:52.020
We'll keep her here today to be safe,
but she can leave tomorrow.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:55.770
Right! Thank you very much!

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:57.690
Oh, yeah! Umm...

00:12:57.770 --> 00:13:01.650
There was a doctor
passing by when she fainted...

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:04.940
That's right. But she doesn't work here.

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:09.620
She said she didn't do much,
so she left without giving her name.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:14.200
Oh. I was hoping to thank her...

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:17.540
Well, if you'll excuse me.
Thank you!

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:25.300
Mom?

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.590
Riko! Are you alright?! How are you feeling?!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.430
I'm okay.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:37.230
Sheesh! You should've said you felt bad!
Though I'm to blame, too.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:44.440
I really did feel fine. But then
my stomach suddenly hurt. I'm sorry.

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:50.620
I was so scared...

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.800
Thanks.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:08.510
The taxi, and my shoes.

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:11.850
Honestly, there's such a thing
as being too panicky.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:18.060
My mind just went blank
the instant I heard Riko had fainted...

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:25.230
Well, perhaps that comes with being a parent...

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:33.450
I guess you have a pretty nice side, too...

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:34.660
Yeah?

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:40.710
Yeah. I wouldn't think you're
someone who uses corpses for business.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:44.170
Are you still stuck on that?
Of course I am.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:49.010
So?
So what?

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:52.720
Are you going to quit your job
of exterminating X-Cons?

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.930
What'll it be? Will you quit fighting?

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:05.320
Well...

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.580
What is it?

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:20.000
I feel something... It's not an X-Con,
it's something different...

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.710
A Neo-Gene?

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:26.540
Yeah. But it isn't Lady.
I've never felt this before...

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:32.930
I have to go!

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:38.810
Wait. There's no need to fight,
if it's a Neo-Gene. Let it pass.

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:44.810
No. She intends to attack me.
I can't afford to fight near Riko.

00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:48.570
Besides... it's telling me to fight!

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:50.900
Are you...

00:15:56.780 --> 00:16:01.040
What if the Witchblade...
Eh?

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:06.960
No, I thought you were
afraid of the Witchblade.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:11.590
Yes, I am. But...

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:16.430
I'm not good at motherly things,
I don't have any marketable skills,

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:18.550
and I don't have any family.

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:22.680
So I want to at least
leave Rihoko some money.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:27.310
Which is why I'll keep fighting!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:29.400
I'll get rid of X-Cons,

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:32.570
and if Neo-Genes want to attack me,
then I'll defeat them, too!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:37.030
I can't afford to die. For Riko's sake...

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:42.500
...I'll go!

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.800
Oh, what's that?

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.920
House blueprints! I'm going to
live here someday with my mom!

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:57.260
Oh, that sounds nice!

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:17.700
Father wants to see you. I'd appreciate
it if you would come with me...

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:18.910
Forget it!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.290
In that case...

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:34.260
Send a recovery team. The wielder's
made contact with a Neo-Gene.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.420
She may require backup.

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:37.590
Understood.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:26.850
Such wonderful resistance!
Almost like a fruit just before it's ripe...

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:35.110
Quit running. I won't take your life.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.690
I wish you wouldn't run!

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:39.990
I'm afraid that's asking too much.

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:54.250
Let's put an end to this, shall we?

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:58.010
Yes. Right after...

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:02.930
...I've pierced you!

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.780
Pull her away somehow!

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:29.660
We can't! They're too close!

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:30.710
Damn it!

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:35.420
Now then, let us go...

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.340
...and see Father.

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:49.560
Shit!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:15.460
Finally managed to get in...

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:19.550
Only way to find out about
the Neo-Genes is from the inside...

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.190
Masamune?!

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:48.700
What the hell's goin' on?!

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:11.680
Riko...

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:26.900
Rihoko...

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:07.280
I murmur, "I love you," with all my emotion

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:16.620
All my feelings until yesterday now overflow and dissolve quickly

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:28.550
If only this one last prayer could make it through...

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.390
Thank you for giving us the words to ascertain each other, God

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:49.400
Tomorrow, we'll reach out and hold hands harder than normal

00:22:49.490 --> 00:23:02.420
Tomorrow, we'll reach out, hug, kiss, and love each other

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:16.350
I'm sorry I didn't
realize you had a cold, Riko.

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:18.640
Is your tummy okay now?

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:23.770
I have work again. I don't think
I'll be coming home easily this time.

00:23:23.860 --> 00:23:26.730
I decided to work hard for you,

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:28.030
but I think I'm going to disappoint you.

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:29.990
I'm so pathetic...

00:23:30.070 --> 00:23:33.320
I really wish I could see your face right now.

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:37.120
Hearing your voice for even
a second would give me strength...

00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:39.950
I'm not a very good mother, am I?
